# =============================================================
# ebook-unbound — gitignore
# =============================================================

# ⚠️ resources/ 是本地写作参考材料与并行写手草稿，
#    含第三方 PDF/EPUB（各自许可）、写手规范与内部草稿，
#    一律不进公开仓库。
resources/

# Build artifacts（与 GitHub Actions 的本地一致命令）
dist/
build/
*.pdf
*.epub
*.mobi
*.azw*

# But track the canonical outputs that are checked-in intentionally
!book/dist/

# Pandoc temp files
*.tmp
*.aux
*.log
*.toc
*.out

# Editor / OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.vscode/
.idea/

# Local secrets (if you ever embed tokens/keys in examples)
*.local
.env

# Notes / scratch
drafts/
scratch/
